1 polymer     nat 'Tubulin alpha-1B chain'                       50204.445  2 ?       ?     ? 
'Native tubulin isolated from HEK 293T cells, unaligned regions are intrinsicly disordered' 
2 polymer     nat 'Tubulin beta chain'                           49717.629  2 ?       ?     ? 
'The C-terminal part of tubulin is intrinsicaly disordered thus not visible in the structure.' 
3 polymer     man 'Tubulin polyglutamylase TTLL11'               111410.188 1 6.3.2.- E441G ? 
;The original protein contains N-terminal Halo tag on a flexible linker so it is not visible in the map or included in the model. TTLL11 containes several instriscally disordered regions that are left out from the model.
